// Cooked food and the campfire (content/base/blocks_food.ron). Cooked meats are the raw
// cut (creature_drops.ron) in browned palettes. Same legend as creature_drops.ron, with
// `k`–`m` for wood or embers.
(
    legend: {
        'f': "fruit:0", 'h': "fruit:1", 'j': "fruit:2",
        'k': "wood:0", 'l': "wood:1", 'm': "wood:2",
        'u': "glow:0", 'v': "glow:1", 'w': "glow:2",
